J8CYlAxYJZGY-eH7WKTgS53w6Q&oe=6AB54125"}, "display_name": "GO CLUBBING\u2122", "keywords": ["SocialVR", "LiveDJ", "MetaAvatars", "MusicEvents", "VirtualNightclub"], "long_description": "# Welcome to GO CLUBBING\u2122\n\n**The next-generation social music platform for Meta Quest.**\n\nExperience live DJs, immersive virtual venues, Meta Avatars and real-time social experiences designed for music lovers around the world.\n\nWhether you're attending a live DJ set, meeting friends, discovering new artists or exploring incredible virtual worlds, GO CLUBBING brings live entertainment into virtual reality like never before.\n\n## Features\n\n- Live DJ performances\n- Full Meta Avatars with voice chat\n- ClubMixed Live streaming integration\n- Twin-screen live entertainment\n- Global multiplayer community\n- Dynamic lighting and immersive visual effects\n- Beautiful virtual venues\n- Built for electronic music fans, DJs, artists and labels\n\n## Explore Amazing Venues\n\n- The Underground\n- Pool Party\n- Mars Sphere\n- Sunset Bar\n- The Time Machine\n- And many more coming soon\n\n## Constantly Evolving\n\nWe're continually adding:\n\n- New venues\n- Live events\n- Creator broadcasts\n- Enhanced avatars\n- Improved networking\n- Better performance\n- Community features\n\nJoin thousands of music fans helping build the future of live entertainment.\n\n## Coming Soon\n\n- \ud83d\ude80 ClubMixed Live integration\n- \ud83c\udfa4 Live creator broadcasts\n- \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f New immersive venues\n- \ud83c\udf89 Private parties\n- \ud83c\udfb6 Record label events\n- \ud83c\udfa5 Live mobile streaming into VR\n- \ud83c\udf0d Community events", "short_description": "Experience live DJs, social clubbing, Meta Avatars and immersive music venues in the next generation of virtual entertainment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.clubmixed.com/go-clubbing-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Recognition Media  T/A ClubMixed ", "support_website_url": "https://www.clubmixed.com/device-instructions/", "website_url": "https://www.clubmixed.com/go-clubbing/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "2687655338230691"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["MUSIC_VIDEO", "SOCIAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "27743536711962369"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_553899486799972_1012019623692426152_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6JNDgZVP5tQQ7kNvwEhCMRW&_nc_oc=Ado6WK4HB2bfIUjdtt80LUs7Y13746J30gJMonE56rEcmNLZr9DMOVdxRApESgdQJ40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ07ULCfma9O711Lep4VZpPiUP4UQZRKS-DIRDEScOWEA&oe=6AB52F24"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "GO CLUBBING\u2122", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Community", "id": "1228796255027646"}, {"topic_name": "Media", "id": "434961926215971"}, {"topic_name": "Events", "id": "2687655338230691"}], "release_date": 1628533975, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "241172717739392", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "3755366971206012", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1410739179298595"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1057332521673832", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GO CLUBBING", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Clubmixed is proud to present Go Clubbing our fully interactive virtual club.  Explore two fabulous rooms with a host of DJs streaming in explosive video and audio sets.  We will be regularly updating this experience with new DJs from around the world but currently, the list is as follows\n\nUnderground Room\n\u2022\tKNOTEN (SW)\n\u2022\tNARK (US)\n\u2022\tSAMMY CALANTHE (US)\n\u2022\tGUTTO SERTA (BR)\n\u2022\tDJ BETTER (KR)\n\u2022\tBEEJAY (KR)\n\u2022\tBLACKLIQUID (US)\n\u2022\tCLOWN WARFARE (UK)\nVIP Room\n\u2022\tIC DJ (UK)\n\u2022\tKROISANT (US)\n\u2022\tECO 3 (VEN)\n\u2022\tCOOLY G (UK)\n\u2022\tDJ RONEY JAY (UK)\n\u2022\tRUBIN PALACIOS (ES)\n\u2022\tJAILHOUSE ROCKS (UK)\nIf you are a DJ and would like to play in our club please contacts us at djservices@clubmixed.com\n\nCUSTOM AVATARS\n\nWE NOW HAVE CUSTOM AVATARS.  Please use the following link to build your own.\n\nhttps://clubmixed.readyplayer.me/\n\nTHEN USE THE LINK TO MAKE A SHORTCODE AND ENTER ON ENTRY TO THE CLUB\n\nhttps://tinyurl.com/app", "short_description": "Clubmixed presents its virtual reality club GO CLUBBING.  Make your own full-bodied and explore our different clubbing environments and dance, chat, and RAVE to your favorite DJs"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BannerLogo.png", "id": "280254377081922", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395422_280254383748588_741753274968684835_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TuTr_hyu528Q7kNvwFlGMeX&_nc_oc=AdrcvjCv5wGkgnFjXmhxpZdVix96Wd_8i9DqpfP6W4PtYLFSE